llama.cpp (reference / influence — not a bulk code import)
----------------------------------------------------------
GGUF loading and model metadata handling in this project were developed with
reference to llama.cpp’s open-source implementation (GGUF ecosystem, header and
metadata conventions). We maintain a custom Rust path (Candle + our loaders);
we do not claim to redistribute llama.cpp as our own, and we do not treat this
as a wholesale copy of large llama.cpp sources into this tree.

  https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp
  License: MIT (llama.cpp project)

Safe short attribution line for docs:

  “GGUF loading and model metadata handling were developed with reference to
   llama.cpp’s open-source implementation.”

